BS.&gt;RS: BudgetStatus
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;RR: findByMonth(month)
RR.&gt;RS: MonthlyReview or none
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 User FS; User: [no data for the month]
RS.&gt;F: throw NoDataException
F.&gt;RV: error message
..=cf1; User: [data available]
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;RS +1: exporterFor(fmt)
RS-&gt;&gt;&gt;EX: export(reportData, path)
